      "coverage": "complete",
      "note": "Clears every occupied slot through 00720850 (index 9 down to 0), builds an 18h-byte parameter record on the stack and issues this->vtable[60h](00E08F60, &record). 00E08F60 is the follow singleton, not an attack command."
