      "note": "Name recovered from the trace literal '---InternalClearPrimaryCommand: %s (%d), mode:%d, (%s, %d)'. The only routine that removes a command. index != 0 drops a queued command and closes the gap; index == 0 completes or replaces the current command, copying slot 0 into the previous-command record at +16Ch and snapping the slot to the target's world position when fewer than two commands remain."
